{
 "_about": "Rudnya (v0.69) ammo only at the bases (the owner, 2026-10-31: \"remove ammo boxes not on bases in 0.69\"; revision 40). All four projects of pack rudnya-069d@3 (day_2, day_3, day_4, day_5). Removed: the two mid-map ammo boxes, by the decent house (32.0, 23.8, -48.6) and by the church (-47.9, 23.1, 12.8): each its two resupply_zone (team 0 and team 1), its decal and its collision_geometry (client_objects), its two stacked item/quest/container_closed models (render_visuals) and their four collision_objects (collision and walker_collision). Kept: the two base boxes, logic/resupply/team1 (64.5, 18.7, 24.6; team 0's nearest spawn 2-13 m, team 1's 135-160 m) and logic/resupply/team2 (-26.6, 22.6, -106.4; team 1's nearest spawn 6-17 m, team 0's 148-172 m), each refilling only the team whose base it is (the owner, 2026-11-01: \"there should only be 2 crates and the team should only be able to refill ammo on the closest crate\"): each box had a resupply_zone for each team, so both teams refilled at both; removed the other team's, logic/resupply/team1/resupply_zone_team1 (team 1) and logic/resupply/team2/resupply_zone (team 0); their shared collision_geometry stays. Changes the simulation (simulation_changes.tsv).",
